<title>ITALY: Italian mutual funds post March net inflow.</title>
<headline>Italian mutual funds post March net inflow.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian investment funds had a net inflow of 5.990 trillion lire in March, compared with a net inflow of 14.920 trillion lire in February, the industry body Assogestioni said.</p>
<p>Equity funds had a net inflow of 1.583 trillion against 2.345 trillion previously.  </p>
<p>				   March 1997	  February 1997</p>
<p> Redemptions (bln lire)    11,551		 11,467</p>
<p> Subscriptions		 17,541		 26,387</p>
<p>Net inflow, outflow (-) from:</p>
<p> Equity funds		   1,583		  2,345</p>
<p>     of which Italian	   -50		     83</p>
<p> Bond funds		     4,079		 12,087</p>
<p> Mixed funds			328		    487</p>
<p>-- Milan bureau +392 66129450</p>
</text>
